<title>USA: Hospitality Properties sells $125 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Hospitality Properties sells $125 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Mass. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hospitality Properties Trust said on Wednesday that it has closed on $125 million in privately placed commercial mortgage pass-through certificates.</p>
<p>The net proceeds from the sales of the certificates was used to repay borrowings on its revolving credit facility and for general business purposes, the company said.</p>
